    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im feeling really bad right now. im type 1 and my sugar feels like its crashing hard... im shaking a ton and i feel really dizzy and confused like i cant really think. i think i need to do something fast but i dont want my sugar to go crazy high later if i just eat sugar. if i just take a tiny bit of my insulin now, like 1 or 2 units of my fast acting, wont that help keep things stable so it doesnt swing too much? i just want to level it out.",
